<title>UK: INSIGHT - Gold stable, platinum to probe higher.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Gold stable, platinum to probe higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   323.00/3.50 *  320.00 * 325.00 *   42 *  322.45 * 329.18</p>
<p> SILVER   4.29/4.31 *    4.17 *   4.40 *   37 *   4.28  *   4.51</p>
<p> PLAT   421.00/4.00 *  400.00 * 430.00 *   57 * 409.62  * 413.10</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - July 25--------------</p>
<p>Gold looks set to hold above $320.00 support on Friday and could possibly probe towards resistance at $325.00, traders and chartists said.</p>
<p>Platinum is expected to probe higher levels despite news that a Russian shipment has arrived in Japan. Traders described the market as still physically tight.</p>
<p>Silver is expected to drift within recent ranges.</p>
</text>
